<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2611537819"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1758892507"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="フローズン"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="TRUE"/><amll:meta key="album" value="フローズン"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:29.796"><div begin="00:16.515" end="03:21.456"><p begin="00:16.515" end="00:17.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">テレスコープ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一直以来都通过望远镜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te re su ko o pu no zo i te</span></p><p begin="00:17.503" end="00:18.787" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">のぞいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从高处俯瞰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te re su ko o pu no zo i te</span></p><p begin="00:18.979" end="00:21.163" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">見つめてる君<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就此注视着你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu me te ru ki mi</span></p><p begin="00:21.814" end="00:24.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">そこにある日常は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">原有的日常仿佛统统都颠倒了般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ko ni a ru ni chi jo u ha ma ru de sa ka sa ma</span></p><p begin="00:24.411" end="00:26.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">まるでさかさま<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如颠倒了一般</span></p><p begin="00:27.240" end="00:29.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">地に足がつかないわ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如何都无法踩到地面</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">chi ni a shi ga tsu ka na i wa</span></p><p begin="00:29.772" end="00:31.892" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">こころうわの空<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真让人心神不宁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro u wa no so ra</span></p><p begin="00:32.619" end="00:34.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">行き場のない想いは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这份无处安放的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ki ba no na i o mo i ha</span></p><p begin="00:35.148" end="00:37.115" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">苦しくなるだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只会让我愈发痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ru shi ku na ru da ke</span></p><p begin="00:42.564" end="00:44.122" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">ああ、辛いや<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 好难受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a tsu ra i ya</span></p><p begin="00:48.834" end="00:49.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">"もしも"<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“如果”之类的咒语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ mo shi mo ” na n te ju mo n</span></p><p begin="00:49.827" end="00:51.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">なんて呪文<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样的咒语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ mo shi mo ” na n te ju mo n</span></p><p begin="00:51.567" end="00:54.234" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">なんの効力もないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然对我来说毫无效果</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n no ko u ryo ku mo na i ke do</span></p><p begin="00:54.550" end="00:56.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">全部ぜーんぶ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我的心里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ze n bu ze e n bu</span></p><p begin="00:56.298" end="00:59.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">わたしとならいいのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是时不时地这样作想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi to na ra i i no ni</span></p><p begin="00:59.228" end="01:01.544" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">って思ってしまうんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望你的一切都与我有关</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">'t te o mo 't te shi ma u n da yo</span></p><p begin="01:01.581" end="01:02.881" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">好きだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki da yo</span></p><p begin="01:02.885" end="01:04.602" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">好き？大好きだ。って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ？</span></p><p begin="01:04.700" end="01:06.779" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">言えていたのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i su ki da 't te i e te i ta no ni</span></p><p begin="01:07.034" end="01:09.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">食べかけのフローズン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吃了一半的冷冻食品</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta be ka ke no fu ro o zu n</span></p><p begin="01:09.336" end="01:11.007" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">シャリシャリな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便是与你那酥酥脆脆的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha ri sha ri na me mo ri i zu</span></p><p begin="01:11.046" end="01:12.458" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">メモリーズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如这些回忆般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="01:12.090" end="01:13.952" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="01:13.381" end="01:14.136" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不足够还不足够还不足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i ta ri na i ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="01:14.153" end="01:14.818" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i ta ri na i ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="01:14.846" end="01:15.433" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">严重缺少你的陪伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi se i bu n ga ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="01:15.448" end="01:17.784" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">君成分が足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的成分完全不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi se i bu n ga ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="01:17.443" end="01:19.171" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="01:18.796" end="01:19.469" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">触れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此渴望碰触你 寒冷难耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ta i fu re ta i tsu me ta i</span></p><p begin="01:19.470" end="01:20.155" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">触れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想触碰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ta i fu re ta i tsu me ta i</span></p><p begin="01:20.164" end="01:20.819" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">冷たい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这份爱冰封之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ko go e cha u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="01:20.875" end="01:23.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">愛凍えちゃう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在爱冻结之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ko go e cha u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="01:23.495" end="01:24.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">温めてよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托你将它重新温暖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ta me te yo ne o ne ga i</span></p><p begin="01:24.971" end="01:25.889" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">お願い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ta me te yo ne o ne ga i</span></p><p begin="01:37.414" end="01:39.637" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">時折見せる表情(かお)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">偶尔流露的表情显得无比成熟</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ki o ri mi se ru ka o o to na bi te i ku ne</span></p><p begin="01:39.949" end="01:42.128" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">大人びていくね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有点成熟呢</span></p><p begin="01:42.742" end="01:45.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">ひらかれる世界に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你所敞开的世界里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ra ka re ru se ka i ni</span></p><p begin="01:45.315" end="01:47.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">わたしはいるかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会有我一席之地吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha i ru ka na</span></p><p begin="01:47.437" end="01:50.657" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">君の夢が叶う魔法<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">施下让你得偿所愿的魔法</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no yu me ga ka na u ma ho u</span></p><p begin="01:50.665" end="01:52.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">秘密のレシピ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是秘密的配方</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi mi tsu no re shi pi</span></p><p begin="01:52.898" end="01:55.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">愛と哀 生成して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱与哀 相辅相生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i to a i se i se i shi te</span></p><p begin="01:55.576" end="01:58.649" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">今日も詠(うた)唱うのです<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天依然在将其咏唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo u mo u ta to na u no de su</span></p><p begin="01:58.316" end="02:00.801" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">ラララララ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦 啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra ra ra ra ra ra ra ra</span></p><p begin="02:00.995" end="02:03.521" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">ララララララ</p><p begin="02:03.596" end="02:06.134" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">ラララララララ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">lalalalala</span></p><p begin="02:06.342" end="02:09.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">ラララララララ</p><p begin="02:09.030" end="02:11.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">ラララララ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦 啦啦啦啦啦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ra ra ra ra ra ra ra ra ra 't te</span></p><p begin="02:11.772" end="02:14.226" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">ラララララって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">lalalalala</span></p><p begin="02:14.482" end="02:16.902" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">懐かしい声<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总觉得听到了令人怀念的声音</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na tsu ka shi i ko e ki ko e ta ki ga shi ta no</span></p><p begin="02:17.126" end="02:19.974" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">聞こえた気がしたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉好像听到了哦</span></p><p begin="02:20.167" end="02:22.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">そばにいるみたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛你就在我身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ba ni i ru mi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:23.876" end="02:25.137" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">好きだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki da yo</span></p><p begin="02:25.144" end="02:26.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">好き？大好きだ。って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ？</span></p><p begin="02:26.923" end="02:29.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">言えていたのに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i su ki da 't te i e te i ta no ni</span></p><p begin="02:29.296" end="02:31.583" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">食べかけのフローズン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吃了一半的冷冻食品</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta be ka ke no fu ro o zu n</span></p><p begin="02:31.596" end="02:33.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">シャリシャリな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">便是与你那酥酥脆脆的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha ri sha ri na me mo ri i zu</span></p><p begin="02:33.339" end="02:34.406" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">メモリーズ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如这些回忆般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki da yo</span></p><p begin="02:34.640" end="02:35.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L58">好きだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我喜欢你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki da yo</span></p><p begin="02:35.941" end="02:37.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L59">好き？大好きだ。って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喜欢？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ？</span></p><p begin="02:37.697" end="02:39.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L60">言い合える日は来る？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这些话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da i su ki da 't te i i a e ru hi ha ku ru ？</span></p><p begin="02:40.043" end="02:41.339" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L61">信じたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想要相信 绝对会爱到底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji ta i ze 't ta i a i shi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:41.342" end="02:42.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L62">絶対<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">绝对哦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji ta i ze 't ta i a i shi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:42.056" end="02:42.765" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L63">愛したい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望与你两情相悦 想要见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi a i ta i na a i ta i na</span></p><p begin="02:42.796" end="02:44.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L64">愛し合いたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要相爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi a i ta i na a i ta i na</span></p><p begin="02:44.167" end="02:45.538" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L65">会いたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好想见到你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="02:45.106" end="02:47.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L66">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="02:46.448" end="02:47.081" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L67">足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不足够还不足够还不足够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i ta ri na i ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="02:47.171" end="02:47.828" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L68">足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ri na i ta ri na i ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="02:47.877" end="02:48.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L69">足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">严重缺少你的陪伴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi se i bu n ga ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="02:48.479" end="02:50.827" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L70">君成分が足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的成分完全不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi se i bu n ga ta ri na i</span></p><p begin="02:50.438" end="02:52.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L71">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="02:51.844" end="02:52.516" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L72">触れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此渴望碰触你 寒冷难耐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ta i fu re ta i tsu me ta i</span></p><p begin="02:52.578" end="02:53.159" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L73">触れたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想触碰</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu re ta i fu re ta i tsu me ta i</span></p><p begin="02:53.227" end="02:53.903" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L74">冷たい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这份爱冰封之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ko go e cha u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="02:53.910" end="02:56.118" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L75">愛凍えちゃう前に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在爱冻结之前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ko go e cha u ma e ni</span></p><p begin="02:55.867" end="02:58.096" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L76">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="03:01.225" end="03:03.488" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L77">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="03:06.672" end="03:08.906" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L78">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="03:12.080" end="03:14.331" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L79">We're stuck in love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(We're stuck in Love)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( We're stuck in love)</span></p><p begin="03:18.129" end="03:19.579" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L80">温めてよね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拜托你将它重新温暖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ta ta me te yo ne o ne ga i</span></p><p begin="03:19.639" end="03:21.45